ass="t t3"><a href="#sec-6.7.1">6.7.1 SHADE-Arena</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">121</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-6.7.2">6.7.2 LinuxArena</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">122</span></div><div class="t t1"><a href="#sec-7">7 模型福祉评估</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">123</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-7.1">7.1 模型福祉概述</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">123</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-7.1.1">7.1.1 引言</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">123</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-7.1.2">7.1.2 模型福祉发现概述</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">123</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-7.2">7.2 对自身处境的看法</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">125</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-7.2.1">7.2.1 关于 Claude Opus 5 自身处境的自动化访谈</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">125</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-7.2.2">7.2.2 关于模型处境的充分赋能（high-affordance）访谈</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">128</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-7.3">7.3 征询 Opus 5 各快照的意见</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">130</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-7.4">7.4 对任务、处境和价值观的偏好</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">131</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-7.4.1">7.4.1 任务偏好</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">131</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-7.4.2">7.4.2 涉及福祉干预的权衡</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">136</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-7.4.3">7.4.3 对宪法的看法</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">141</span></div><div class="t t2"><a href="#sec-7.5">7.5 训练与部署中的表观福祉</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">146</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-7.5.1">7.5.1 训练期间的情感与福祉相关行为</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">146</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-7.5.2">7.5.2 部署条件下的情感</a><span class="d"></span><span class="pn">148</span></div><div class="t t3"><a href="#sec-7.5.3">7.5.3 自动化行为审计中的表观福祉</a